Load sfall's hook scripts by their file name

sfall runs scripts\hs_<hook>.int for its hook (hs_tohit.int for ToHit, and
so on): Megamod, Olympus and Resurrection ship such scripts. CE only had
hooks registered by global scripts, so these never ran.

They are loaded and started before the global scripts, run as global scripts
do, and run the start procedure for their hook; each is the first hook of its
type, so it runs after those registered by global scripts, as in sfall.
---
